{"segments": [
 {"id": "c05-title-01", "scene": "c05-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Chapter five. A fixed word still has a job.", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["title"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-01", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "A pronoun never changes its last vowel.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["p:1"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-02", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "Its ending cannot show rafʿ, naṣb or jarr.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-rule-03", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "But it still does a job in the sentence, like any noun.", "pause": 0.6, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-rule-04", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "Here is the rule. The place of rafʿ.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["rule"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-05", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "Look at this sentence. He is a student.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-rule-06", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "ar", "text": "هُوَ طَالِبٌ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["hl:هُوَ طَالِبٌ"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-07", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "The word for he is the Topic.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:هُوَ@2"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-08", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "A Topic is rafʿ.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-rule-09", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "But this word cannot show a damma. Its ending is fixed.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["hl:cannot show a damma"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-10", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "So we say it is in the place of rafʿ.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["hl:in the place of rafʿ"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-11", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "ar", "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["hl:فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ"]},
 {"id": "c05-rule-12", "scene": "c05-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "The ending shows no sign. But the job still gives the word its place.", "pause": 0.8, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-01", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "So we describe a fixed word in two steps.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["p:1"]},
 {"id": "c05-steps-02", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "First its job. Then its place.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["hl:first its job, then its place"]},
 {"id": "c05-steps-03", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "Here is our sentence again, word by word.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["head"]},
 {"id": "c05-steps-04", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "The first word.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:1"]},
 {"id": "c05-steps-05", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "ar", "text": "هُوَ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-06", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "Its job is the Topic. Its ending is fixed. It never changes.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-07", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "So it is in the place of rafʿ.", "pause": 0.6, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-08", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "The second word.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:2"]},
 {"id": "c05-steps-09", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "ar", "text": "طَالِبٌ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-10", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "Its job is the Information. It ends in tanween damma, and you can see it.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-11", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "So it is simply rafʿ.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-steps-12", "scene": "c05-steps", "lang": "en", "text": "Both words are rafʿ. The Information shows it on its ending. The Topic has it only in its place.", "pause": 0.8, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-tip-01", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "Good to know. There are three places.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["show"]},
 {"id": "c05-tip-02", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "ar", "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:فِي مَحَلِّ رَفْعٍ"]},
 {"id": "c05-tip-03", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "The place of rafʿ.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-tip-04", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "ar", "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:فِي مَحَلِّ نَصْبٍ"]},
 {"id": "c05-tip-05", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "The place of naṣb.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-tip-06", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "ar", "text": "فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:فِي مَحَلِّ جَرٍّ"]},
 {"id": "c05-tip-07", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "The place of jarr.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c05-tip-08", "scene": "c05-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "In this stage, these twelve pronouns are always in the place of rafʿ.", "pause": 0.8, "cues": ["hl:always in the place of rafʿ"]}
]}
